    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/66-huntstown-wood-mulhuddart-dublin-d15-wva8\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 66 Huntstown Wood, Mulhuddart.\r\n\r\nNestled in the sought-after area of Mulhuddart, this is a charming three-bedroom terraced home. The exterior showcases a classic design with a well-maintained façade. There is an easily accessible driveway offering convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the spacious hallway leads to a thoughtfully designed kitchen, boasting modern cabinetry and ample counter space. Large windows allow natural light to fill the room, making it a perfect space for culinary creativity. Adjacent to the kitchen, the open-plan lounge and dining area features a bright and airy layout, enhanced by large doors leading to the rear garden. The garden itself is a practical space, ideal for outdoor entertainment or relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor also includes a versatile room with an adjoining bathroom, perfect for use as an additional bedroom or a home office, offering flexible living options.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises three generously sized bedrooms, both equipped with built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom offers peaceful views and a tranquil atmosphere. A well-appointed family bathroom services the upper floor, designed with contemporary fixtures and finishes.\r\n\r\nLocated in a family-friendly neighbourhood, this property benefits from excellent transport links, including nearby bus stops and easy access to main road networks, ensuring seamless journeys across Dublin. Local amenities include reputable schools, sports clubs, and shopping facilities catering to all daily needs.\r\n\r\n66 Huntstown Wood represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers seeking a comfortable family home or for investors looking for a robust addition to their portfolio. Its practical layout, modern extensions, and desirable location make it a splendid choice for those valuing convenience and charm."
      },
